# Claude Code
# Ignore local Claude Code state, but share ONE file: settings.json carries the
# attribution config, which has to reach every environment that commits from
# this repo -- including the scheduled cloud routines, which is the whole point.
# A directory pattern cannot be re-included from inside, so this ignores the
# CONTENTS rather than the directory.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
CLAUDE.md

